        Tinarchy OS Live Installation & Appliance Environment
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Welcome to Tinarchy OS Live!

  To install Tinarchy OS to your drive, run:
    # tinarchy-installer

  Quick Tools:
    • iwctl               - Configure wireless Wi-Fi connections
    • nmtui               - NetworkManager interactive network UI
    • lsblk               - View available disks and partitions
    • tinarchy-installer  - Guided partitioner, pacstrap & OS deployer

